---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Education — The Forktree Project" description="Experiential sustainability education for young people at The Forktree Project.">

  <!-- Education Hero Section -->
  <section class="edu-section edu-section--hero" style="background-image: url('/images/education/education-hero.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="edu-section__content edu-section__content--center">
      <div class="edu-text edu-text--wide">
        <h1>Experiential Education at The Forktree Project</h1>

        <div class="edu-body">
          <p>A key part of the mission of The Forktree Project is to educate young people about biodiversity, the importance of habitat restoration and the need for sustainable choices in all areas of our lives.</p>

          <p>The Forktree Project Education Program is underpinned by a passionate belief in both the value of genuine, hands-on experiential learning and the importance of empowering young people to be part of the solution to the climate and biodiversity crises through active involvement in habitat restoration.</p>

          <p>It is also built on a conviction that time spent in and caring for nature is hugely beneficial to the mental health and wellbeing of individuals and communities.</p>

          <p>The Forktree Project takes pride in working closely with schools to link students&rsquo; experiences to different learning areas of the Australian Curriculum, as well as SACE and IB curricula, according to each school&rsquo;s specific needs. To read what other schools have to say, read our testimonials by <a href="/testimonials">clicking here.</a></p>

          <p>The Forktree Project welcomes both primary and secondary schools for day excursions, overnight camping experiences and extended programs.</p>

          <p><a href="https://forktree.app">Click here for more information</a></p>

          <div class="edu-cta">
            <a href="/get-involved" class="btn--cta">Get in Touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section class="edu-section edu-section--testimonials" style="background-image: url('/images/education/education-hero.jpg'); background-color: #1a2a1a;">
    <div class="edu-section__content edu-section__content--center">
      <div class="edu-testimonials">
        <h2>What Schools Are Saying</h2>
        <div class="edu-testimonials__grid">

          <blockquote class="edu-testimonial-card" data-testimonial>
            <div class="edu-testimonial-card__body">
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__collapsed">
                <p class="edu-testimonial-card__pullquote">&ldquo;A perfect choice for students from Reception through to Year 12.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;The Forktree Project provides students and teachers alike with a hands-on understanding around the importance of maintaining and developing our native biodiversity. On site students learn by doing, concreting ideas of sustainability, circular economy and carbon sequestration, all under the tutelage of a highly skilled and knowledgeable team. <span class="edu-testimonial-card__highlight">A perfect choice for students from Reception through to Year 12.</span>&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="edu-testimonial-card__cite">&mdash; Blackwood High School</cite>
              <button class="edu-testimonial-card__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="edu-testimonial-card" data-testimonial>
            <div class="edu-testimonial-card__body">
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__collapsed">
                <p class="edu-testimonial-card__pullquote">&ldquo;Learning doesn&rsquo;t get any more hands-on and tangible than this!&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Visiting The Forktree Project with our Year 8 cohort is one of the most hands-on and valuable excursions I have attended. Our students absolutely thrived while working under the guidance of Tim and Liz and their team. The students learnt about sustainability and circular economy by getting stuck into some hard work and our school is incredibly lucky to have a relationship with The Forktree Project. <span class="edu-testimonial-card__highlight">Learning doesn&rsquo;t get any more hands-on and tangible than this!</span>&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="edu-testimonial-card__cite">&mdash; Tatachilla Lutheran College</cite>
              <button class="edu-testimonial-card__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="edu-testimonial-card" data-testimonial>
            <div class="edu-testimonial-card__body">
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__collapsed">
                <p class="edu-testimonial-card__pullquote">&ldquo;The Forktree Project offers an effective platform for students to think globally and act locally.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Liz and Tim work tirelessly to promote and support efforts to protect the integrity of our environment. Their important vision has attracted a multidisciplinary team who are committed to combatting climate change through encouraging sustainable practices, restoring habitat through rewilding and focusing on sequestration. Forktree enables students to participate in a range of tasks that show them they are quite literally planting the seeds of a greener future - a concrete, tangible means of combatting climate anxiety among the next generation. Our school will continue visiting Forktree to supplement students&rsquo; environmental education with practical application. <span class="edu-testimonial-card__highlight">The Forktree Project offers an effective platform for students to think globally and act locally.</span> It is a relationship we are proud of and look forward to seeing thrive.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="edu-testimonial-card__cite">&mdash; Prince Alfred College</cite>
              <button class="edu-testimonial-card__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="edu-testimonial-card" data-testimonial>
            <div class="edu-testimonial-card__body">
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__collapsed">
                <p class="edu-testimonial-card__pullquote">&ldquo;We wholeheartedly endorse this initiative and encourage other schools to participate.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Our students have expressed their excitement and satisfaction with the project, with students commenting that it was their favourite learning activity for the year! We are grateful for the opportunity to be part of The Forktree Project and look forward to continuing our involvement in the future. <span class="edu-testimonial-card__highlight">We wholeheartedly endorse this initiative and encourage other schools to participate and experience the benefits for themselves.</span>&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="edu-testimonial-card__cite">&mdash; Adelaide Botanic High School</cite>
              <button class="edu-testimonial-card__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="edu-testimonial-card" data-testimonial>
            <div class="edu-testimonial-card__body">
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__collapsed">
                <p class="edu-testimonial-card__pullquote">&ldquo;The sequential approach has undoubtedly left a lasting mark on our students.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Annesley&rsquo;s collaboration with The Forktree Project has been transformative. The bespoke extended program developed by The Forktree Project not only addressed our specific outcomes but also gave students a sense of ownership of the Carrickalinga site. <span class="edu-testimonial-card__highlight">The sequential approach has undoubtedly left a lasting mark on our students</span> giving them confidence when leading their peers through various experiences related to the amazing work that the Forktree Project team are doing.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="edu-testimonial-card__cite">&mdash; Annesley Junior School</cite>
              <button class="edu-testimonial-card__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="edu-testimonial-card" data-testimonial>
            <div class="edu-testimonial-card__body">
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__collapsed">
                <p class="edu-testimonial-card__pullquote">&ldquo;Tim and Liz are incredible ambassadors and live by example.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="edu-testimonial-card__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Operation Flinders Next Step program absolutely loved our time at Forktree - it was eye-opening for the young people to see what is being achieved by the project and to have the ability to engage in a practical, hands-on, real-life effort. To be able to camp onsite at such a beautiful location was amazing and the young people loved being able to go for walks, do yoga and immerse themselves in the beautiful surroundings. <span class="edu-testimonial-card__highlight">Tim and Liz are incredible ambassadors and live by example,</span> working hard alongside the young people.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="edu-testimonial-card__cite">&mdash; Operation Flinders</cite>
              <button class="edu-testimonial-card__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Carbon Assessment Section -->
  <section class="edu-section" style="background-image: url('/images/education/carbon-hero.jpg'); background-color: #1a2a1a;">
    <div class="edu-section__content edu-section__content--center">
      <div class="edu-text edu-text--wide">
        <h1>Carbon Assessment Methodologies</h1>

        <div class="edu-body">
          <p>Small/medium sized properties in Australia have a significant role to play in protecting biodiversity and combatting climate change through sequestering carbon dioxide.</p>

          <p>However, to enable them to better perform this role, carbon funding needs to be made more accessible to encourage landowners to make the effort to restore the land. The current Australian carbon credit system for small/medium-sized properties is complex and prohibitively expensive.</p>

          <p>Forktree is trialling several methodologies for quantifying carbon stored in both the soil and trees and plants on the site and will use these experiences both to work out carbon sequestration rates and also to inform discussions on improving the policy framework to accept simpler processes.</p>

          <p>For more information on The Forktree Project&rsquo;s carbon assessment trials, or to get involved, please contact us.</p>

          <div class="edu-cta">
            <a href="/get-involved" class="btn--cta">Get in Touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  .edu-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: scroll;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .edu-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 45%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0%, transparent 100%),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .edu-section__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    padding: 180px 100px;
  }

  .edu-section__content--center {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .edu-text {
    max-width: 50%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .edu-text--wide {
    max-width: 65%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .edu-text h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .edu-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .edu-body a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .edu-body a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .edu-downloads {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .edu-downloads a {
    font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1.2vw, 0.95rem);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .edu-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .btn--cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: white;
    border: 2px solid white;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .btn--cta:hover {
    background-color: white;
    color: #000;
  }

  /* Testimonials */
  .edu-testimonials {
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .edu-testimonials h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .edu-testimonials__grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border-left: none;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.8;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__pullquote {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__collapsed {
    display: block;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__expanded {
    display: none;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card--open .edu-testimonial-card__collapsed {
    display: none;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card--open .edu-testimonial-card__expanded {
    display: block;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card--open .edu-testimonial-card__toggle {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__highlight {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__toggle {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__toggle:hover {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .edu-testimonial-card__cite {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .edu-section {
      background-attachment: scroll;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .edu-section__content {
      padding: 100px 30px;
    }

    .edu-text,
    .edu-text--wide {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.edu-testimonial-card__toggle').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const card = btn.closest('[data-testimonial]');
      if (card) {
        const isOpen = card.classList.toggle('edu-testimonial-card--open');
        btn.innerHTML = isOpen ? '&larr; Show less' : 'Read full testimonial &rarr;';
      }
    });
  });
</script>
